  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clean Water &amp; Food Forest for 300+ Kenyan children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide plentiful water, hygiene facilities and plant a food forest at Elong&apos;o primary school pupils and staff can easily grow their own food.  With access to clean water, children will no longer have to carry jerrycans of water to school. Illness and disease will be reduced with improved hygiene facilities.  The forest will invigorate the barren landscape around the school, provide the children with a more varied diet, and provide an income source to the school.</narrative>
  </description>
